1. Definitions

"Licensor" means the copyright holder or other person authorized to grant
these permissions for the project-owned material covered by this license.

"Project Material" means the project-owned source code, documentation,
configuration, build files, scripts, tests, and other material in this
repository that is marked with SPDX identifier LicenseRef-STM32-UDS-Research-Education-Commercial-1.0, or is otherwise
identified as project-owned in the repository documentation. Project Material
does not include Third-Party Material described in Section 5.

"Qualifying Research and Education Use" means use of Project Material solely
for personal study, teaching, academic work, non-profit education, or
non-commercial research, where the use is not part of a product or service,
does not support an organization's ordinary business or production operations,
and is not used to generate revenue or commercial advantage. A grant-funded or
sponsored activity is not Qualifying Research and Education Use if the material
is used for an industrial or commercial sponsor's product, service, or
operations.

"Commercial Use" means any use that is not Qualifying Research and Education
Use, including industrial use, production deployment, internal business use,
use in a product or service, use for a paying customer, or use that provides a
commercial or competitive advantage.

"Large-Scale Use" means deployment or operation involving more than ten (10)
deployed devices, more than one hundred (100) end users, multiple operational
sites, or a production or field deployment. Large-Scale Use requires a paid
commercial license even when the activity is otherwise research-oriented.

